        "original_id": "58f609b7-5839-5e87-964b-30350041b24e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Captain Horatio Hornblower, To Kill a Mockingbird\n- People: Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, Terence Morgan, Gerry Mitchell, Raoul Walsh, Atticus Finch\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n- Organizations: Royal Navy, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower is a 1951 American naval swashbuckling war film in Technicolor from Warner Bros.\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower was produced by Gerry Mitchell and directed by Raoul Walsh.\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower is also known in the UK as Captain Horatio Hornblower R.N., with \"R.N.\" standing for \"Royal Navy.\"\n- Captain Horatio Hornblower stars Gregory Peck, Virginia Mayo, Robert Beatty, and Terence Morgan.\n- Gregory Peck won the Academy Award for Best Actor for his performance as Atticus Finch in the 1962 film To Kill a Mockingbird.",
